[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 19.24,
    "text": "Take a slow breath in"
  },
  {
    "start": 19.24,
    "end": 24.92,
    "text": "and let it go"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.92,
    "end": 45.1,
    "text": "Let your body settle into this moment, as if the space around you is widening, just enough"
  },
  {
    "start": 45.1,
    "end": 55.58,
    "text": "for you to breathe more freely."
  },
  {
    "start": 55.58,
    "end": 67.78,
    "text": "Bring your attention to the simple feeling of breathing."
  },
  {
    "start": 67.78,
    "end": 81.54,
    "text": "Notice the air moving in"
  },
  {
    "start": 81.54,
    "end": 91.68,
    "text": "and the air moving out."
  },
  {
    "start": 91.68,
    "end": 106.96,
    "text": "Nothing else to manage, nothing to organize."
  },
  {
    "start": 106.96,
    "end": 117.24,
    "text": "Breath and presence."
  },
  {
    "start": 117.24,
    "end": 122.88,
    "text": "Thoughts may still be moving."
  },
  {
    "start": 122.88,
    "end": 131.14,
    "text": "That is completely okay."
  },
  {
    "start": 131.14,
    "end": 136.12,
    "text": "There is no need to stop them."
  },
  {
    "start": 136.12,
    "end": 142.28,
    "text": "Just let them fade a little into the background."
  },
  {
    "start": 142.28,
    "end": 149.7,
    "text": "Make distant sound."
  },
  {
    "start": 149.7,
    "end": 155.14,
    "text": "While your awareness rests gently here."
  },
  {
    "start": 155.14,
    "end": 163.34,
    "text": "Feel your shoulders loosen."
  },
  {
    "start": 163.34,
    "end": 173.46,
    "text": "Feel your jaw soften."
  },
  {
    "start": 173.46,
    "end": 177.66,
    "text": "Feel your breath slow."
  },
  {
    "start": 177.66,
    "end": 188.44,
    "text": "In its own natural way."
  },
  {
    "start": 188.44,
    "end": 199.12,
    "text": "Inside you there is a quiet place"
  },
  {
    "start": 199.12,
    "end": 204.02,
    "text": "That does not rush"
  },
  {
    "start": 204.02,
    "end": 210.08,
    "text": "And does not push"
  },
  {
    "start": 210.08,
    "end": 216.34,
    "text": "A place that becomes easier to feel"
  },
  {
    "start": 216.34,
    "end": 223.1,
    "text": "Each time you return to your breath"
  },
  {
    "start": 223.1,
    "end": 230.06,
    "text": "Let your mind settle toward that space now"
  },
  {
    "start": 230.06,
    "end": 236.06,
    "text": "Not by effort"
  },
  {
    "start": 236.06,
    "end": 240.68,
    "text": "But by allowing"
  },
  {
    "start": 240.68,
    "end": 251.44,
    "text": "Let the next exhale be a gentle release"
  },
  {
    "start": 251.44,
    "end": 257.44,
    "text": "Soften whatever the mind is holding"
  },
  {
    "start": 257.44,
    "end": 258.44,
    "text": "With each breath"
  },
  {
    "start": 258.44,
    "end": 261.44,
    "text": "Thoughts become lighter"
  },
  {
    "start": 261.44,
    "end": 263.2,
    "text": "And the inner space becomes clearer"
  },
  {
    "start": 279.2,
    "end": 280.2,
    "text": "You are not trying to empty the mind"
  },
  {
    "start": 280.2,
    "end": 282.96,
    "text": "Empty the mind"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.96,
    "end": 290.96,
    "text": "You are simply letting it rest"
  },
  {
    "start": 290.96,
    "end": 296.96,
    "text": "Take one more slow inhale"
  },
  {
    "start": 296.96,
    "end": 300.96,
    "text": "And let the exhale settle through your whole body"
  },
  {
    "start": 300.96,
    "end": 305.72,
    "text": "A little more quiet"
  },
  {
    "start": 310.72,
    "end": 311.72,
    "text": "A little more space"
  },
  {
    "start": 313.72,
    "end": 315.72,
    "text": "A clearer mind to move forward with"
  },
  {
    "start": 315.72,
    "end": 317.72,
    "text": "Take this sense of quiet with you"
  },
  {
    "start": 317.72,
    "end": 319.48,
    "text": "And when you need another pause"
  },
  {
    "start": 319.48,
    "end": 335.48,
    "text": "Come back and settle in again"
  }
]
